90338e17a063c6fc6ba421c942d619e9 3x"}, "duration": null, "nsfw": false, "hardcore": false, "consored_thumbnail_image_urls": {"src": "https://si.imgix.net/1d3ad250/uploads/origins/415be7d0-f74c-4f62-86cf-68d55505780f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=b12e584828032c944bb5a1a5682f57c9", "srcset": "https://si.imgix.net/1d3ad250/uploads/origins/415be7d0-f74c-4f62-86cf-68d55505780f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=b12e584828032c944bb5a1a5682f57c9, https://si.imgix.net/1d3ad250/uploads/origins/415be7d0-f74c-4f62-86cf-68d55505780f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=2&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=8f165e86c1877506226903c6fbf85850 2x, https://si.imgix.net/1d3ad250/uploads/origins/415be7d0-f74c-4f62-86cf-68d55505780f?bg=%23fff&auto=format%2Ccompress&fm=webp&dpr=3&fit=crop&crop=top&w=200&h=200&blur=200&s=44f561b5d6089608f579261ae08c8f5c 3x"}, "body": "I saw a very cute illustration on twitter and fell in love at first sight. I really like the pop and vivid colors! Would it be possible for you to draw a Lalafell boy, my character from Final Fantasy 14? I think it is difficult, but please consider it. I will leave everything to you. It's okay without weapons, and you don't have to bring the pattern to the original. I hope you can draw it as you like. If there were rough sketches or time-lapses in the process of creating the illustration, I would be very happy if I could receive all of that data as well! It's okay as long as it's reasonable. [About the character] An 18-year-old boy. Her charm points are her freckles and headband with ears. He has a snobbish and impertinent personality. that's all, thank you very much.\n\nhttps://imgur.com/a/qEcMuGw", "nc": 0, "word_count": 0, "transcoder": "image", "creator_acceptable_same_genre": true}, {"path": "/@kotenihe_art/works/4", "private_thumbnail_image_urls": null, "private": false, "genre": "art", "tipped": true, "creat